# Backup System

**Server:** 198.54.123.234 · **Dashboard:** https://fullpotential.ai/admin/backup (user: admin).

## Directory map

```
/opt/fpai/backups/
├── services/       # Backend services
├── dashboards/     # UI (god-mode, collab-hub)
├── websites/       # Public sites (fullpotential.ai)
├── nginx/          # nginx configs
└── manifest.json   # Master record
```

## Scripts

- **List:** `/opt/fpai/scripts/list-backups.sh [service]`
- **Pre-deploy backup:** `/opt/fpai/scripts/pre-deploy-backup.sh <service> <version>`
- **Restore:** `/opt/fpai/scripts/restore-service.sh <service> {latest|v1.2.0}`
- **Safe deploy wrapper (local):** `./infra/scripts/safe-deploy.sh <service> <cmd>`

## Hard constraints

- **Never delete anything in `/opt/fpai/backups/`.**
- **Never deploy without a backup.** The safe-deploy wrapper enforces this — prefer it.
- **Never overwrite existing backups.** Use a new version number.

If you need to roll back without a clean backup path, stop and ask.

Related: `@docs/coordination/MEMORY/VERSION_CONTROL_PROTOCOL.md`.
